---
title: "Shayad"
artist: "Bollywood"
key: "C"
tags: ["hindi"]
---

Shayad Guitar Chords with strumming pattern sung by Arijit Singh from Bollywood Hindi movie Love Aaj Kal.

Strumming pattern: D D UUUD

[C]Shayad kabhi na [D]keh sakun me [G]tum ko,        [Am]Kahe bina [D]samajhlo tum [Em]shayad
[C]Shayad mere [D]khayal me tum [G]ikk din,        [Am]Milo mujhe [D]kahi pe ghum [Em]shayad

Jo tum na [G]ho… rahengey [C]hum nahi,        Jo tum na [Em]ho… rahenge [D]hum nahi
Na chaahiye [Bm]kuch tum se [C]jaada tumse [Em]kam nahi

Jo tum na [Em]ho.. to hum bhi [D]hum nhi,        Jo tum na [C]ho… to hum bhi [D]hum nhi
Na chaahiye [Bm]kuch tum se [C]jaada tumse [Em]kam nahi

[Bm]Aankhon ko khwaab dena,        [C]Khud he sawal krke
[G]Khud he jawab dena [D]teri taraf se,        [Bm]Bin kaam-kaam krna
[C]Jaana kahi ho chahe,        [G]Har baar he guzrna [D]teri taraf se

Yeh koshi [G]shein to hongi [C]kam nahi,        Yeh koshi [Em]shein to hongi [D]kam nahi
Na chahiye [Bm]kuch tum se [C]zyaada tumse kam [Em]nahi

Jo tum na [Em]ho.. toh hum bhi [D]hum nahin,        Jo tum na [C]ho… toh hum bhi [D]hum nahin
Na chahiye [Bm]kuch tum se [C]zyaada tum se [Em]kam nahin
